crates/install/punktfunk-setup-win/src/wizard/network.rs	Windows scopes the standard firewall rules to private networks, so on this network the host would be silently unreachable. VPN and virtual adapters are routinely Public by design — this changes only the named network, never a global setting.
crates/install/punktfunk-setup-win/src/wizard/welcome.rs	Choose whether a desktop shortcut is added.
crates/install/punktfunk-setup-win/src/wizard/welcome.rs	Install into your profile with Start-menu shortcuts.
crates/install/punktfunk-setup-win/src/wizard/welcome.rs	Pick the drivers, Moonlight compatibility, firewall scope, autostart and the console password yourself.
crates/install/punktfunk-setup-win/src/wizard/welcome.rs	Reconfigure keeps what is on this PC and applies your changes. Uninstall removes it — identity, pairings and passwords stay.
crates/install/punktfunk-setup-win/src/wizard/welcome.rs	The defaults: virtual display and gamepad drivers, the HDR layer, a tray icon, and the service starts right away. A web console password is generated for you.
crates/install/punktfunk-setup-win/src/wizard/welcome.rs	This PC becomes a device you play on: the punktfunk client shows the stream from the PC you stream from.
crates/install/punktfunk-setup-win/src/wizard/welcome.rs	This PC becomes the one you stream from: the punktfunk host sends its screen, audio and games to the devices you play on.
crates/install/punktfunk-setup-win/src/wizard/welcome.rs	This removes punktfunk from this PC. Identity, pairings and passwords stay — a reinstall picks them up.
